  "description": "Daniel Perez is a software engineer and researcher based in London. He is the co-founder of TLX, a leveraged token protocol, and Gyroscope, a non-custodial stablecoin.\r\nDaniel holds a PhD in blockchain security from Imperial College London, during which he focused on making Ethereum safer, with an emphasis on the EVM and Solidity."
